# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.

# Both enquiry forms (/contact-us and the "Get a Quote" panel) send via
# FormSubmit (https://formsubmit.co) - no API key needed, and no env vars
# either: the destination address is hardcoded in app/api/enquiry/route.ts
# (env-based config was causing delivery issues in prod). The first
# submission to a new destination address triggers a one-time confirmation
# email from FormSubmit that has to be clicked before further submissions
# actually deliver.
